@page
@using Zagent.Shared
@{
    Layout = null;
}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>Zagent UI1</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/dashboard.css" /><script defer src="/dashboard.js"></script></head>
<body><aside><div class="brand">Z<span>agent</span><small>CORE1 / UI1 · @ZagentProductInfo.UiVersion</small></div>
<nav aria-label="Management"><a href="#overview">Overview</a><a href="#agents">Agents</a><a href="#workspaces">Workspaces &amp; approvals</a><a href="#connections">Connections</a><a href="#jobs">Jobs &amp; workflows</a><a href="#artifacts">Artifacts</a><a href="#diagnostics">Diagnostics</a><a href="#logs">Logs</a><a href="#settings">Settings</a></nav>
<p class="boundary">Private management plane<br />Windows per-user desktop<br />Remote access OFF</p></aside>
<main><header><div><small>INSTALLATION CONTROL</small><h1 id="heading">Overview</h1></div><span class="secondary">Local Windows owner</span></header>
<p id="freshness" role="status">Waiting for an authenticated snapshot…</p><p id="notice" role="status"></p>
<section id="overview" class="page"><div class="toolbar"><button data-runtime="startAll">Start all agents</button><button data-runtime="stopAll" class="secondary">Stop all agents</button><button id="shutdown" class="danger">Stop Core</button></div><p class="muted">Closing this tab does not stop Core or its agents. Stop Core also disconnects this dashboard; restart from the Windows shortcut.</p><div id="overview-content"></div></section>
<section id="agents" class="page" hidden><p class="muted">State is observed by the existing Core supervisor. MCP readiness does not imply ArcMap desktop/CURRENT readiness.</p><div id="agents-content"></div><h2>Capabilities</h2><div id="capabilities-content"></div></section>
<section id="workspaces" class="page" hidden><p class="muted">Direct owner profile administration: changes commit to the shared Files backend without a laptop approval request. Removing a profile never deletes its files. Browser/other-agent approvals remain separate.</p><form id="profile-form" class="form-row"><label>Profile ID<input name="target_profile_id" required maxlength="256" pattern="[A-Za-z0-9_\-]{1,256}" /></label><label>Root directory<input name="root" required /></label><label>Access<select name="mode"><option value="read-only">Read only</option><option value="read-write">Read/write</option></select></label><label>Enabled<input type="checkbox" name="enabled" checked /></label><label>Description<input name="description" maxlength="512" /></label><button type="submit">Create profile</button></form><div id="workspaces-content"></div></section>
<section id="connections" class="page" hidden><div class="toolbar"><button data-integration="chrome.check">Check browser</button><button data-integration="arcmap.check">Check ArcMap</button></div><div id="connections-content"></div><h2>MCP routes</h2><div id="routes-content"></div></section>
<section id="jobs" class="page" hidden><p class="muted">Cancel is a cooperative request, not proof of rollback. Unknown outcomes require reconciliation; the dashboard never auto-replays jobs.</p><div id="jobs-content"></div><h2>Workflow evidence</h2><form id="workflow-form" class="form-row"><label>Principal ID<input name="principalId" required /></label><label>Run ID (optional)<input name="runId" /></label><button type="submit">Read journal</button></form><div id="workflows-content"></div></section>
<section id="artifacts" class="page" hidden><p class="muted">Downloads require a workspace-scoped manifest, recent capture and matching SHA-256. No filesystem paths or active HTML previews are served.</p><div id="artifacts-content"></div></section>
<section id="diagnostics" class="page" hidden><p class="muted">Owner-only structured diagnostics. Captures instrumented boundaries, not every possible error. Missing or empty records are not proof of health. Process state is not MCP readiness. Reports exclude raw logs, private configuration and exception text; no automatic remediation.</p>
<form id="diagnostics-form" class="form-row"><label>Component<select name="component"><option value="">All components</option><option value="core">Core</option><option value="router">Router</option><option value="files">Files</option></select></label><label>Severity<select name="severity"><option value="">All severities</option><option value="error">Error</option><option value="warning">Warning</option><option value="info">Info</option></select></label><label>Exact request ID<input name="requestId" maxlength="32" pattern="[a-f0-9]{32}" /></label><label>Search current bounded events<input id="diagnostics-search" type="search" maxlength="128" /></label><button type="submit">Refresh diagnostics</button><a id="diagnostics-export" href="/api/management/v1/diagnostics/export?limit=200" download="zagent-diagnostics.json">Export safe JSON</a></form>
<p id="diagnostics-status" role="status">Diagnostics not available; no current snapshot.</p><div id="diagnostics-runtime"></div><h2>Diagnostic sources</h2><div id="diagnostics-sources"></div><h2>Latest events</h2><div id="diagnostics-events"></div></section>
<section id="logs" class="page" hidden><p class="muted">Bounded operational log, not a conversation history. Sensitive values are redacted.</p><div id="logs-content"></div></section>
<section id="settings" class="page" hidden><p class="muted">Credentials and TLS are provisioned offline by the Windows account owner; no password, token or enrollment endpoint is exposed here.</p><div id="settings-content"></div></section>
<noscript>JavaScript is required for live management data. No cached or sample status is shown.</noscript>
</main><dialog id="shutdown-dialog" class="shutdown-dialog" aria-labelledby="shutdown-title" aria-describedby="shutdown-description">
<h2 id="shutdown-title">Hentikan Core?</h2>
<p id="shutdown-description">Core dan seluruh agen akan dihentikan. Dashboard akan terputus. Gunakan launcher untuk menjalankan Zagent kembali.</p>
<p id="shutdown-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
<div class="shutdown-actions"><button id="shutdown-cancel" type="button" class="secondary" autofocus>Batalkan</button><button id="shutdown-confirm" type="button" class="danger">Stop Core</button></div>
</dialog></body></html>
